#. ねぇ、苗木誠殿…
msgctxt "0001 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Hey, Mr. Naegi?"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？　どうしたの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah? What's up?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは信頼に足る人物だと思うから…
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I feel like you're worthy of my trust, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな苗木誠殿だけに…
#. 告白しますけどね…
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "You're the only one...I can confess to."
msgstr ""

#. 僕はもう限界です。
#. 今すぐ、ここから出たいです。
msgctxt "0005 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I've reached my limit. I need to get out of here.\n"
"Right now."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな…
#. ニコニコしながら言わないでよ…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"H-Hey, come on. Don't talk like that when you've got\n"
"that creepy grin on your face..."
msgstr ""

#. だって…会いたいんだもん…
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I need to see her."
msgstr ""

#. テレビで…
#. 実物のぶー子ちゃんに会いたいんだもん…
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I need to get to a TV. I need to see the real Princess\n"
"Piggles."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アニメなんだから実物も何もないんじゃ…
#. なんて言ってる場合じゃないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's he mean, \"real\"? She's a cartoon character.\n"
"But now might be a bad time to bring that up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 山田クン…そんなに落ち込まないでよ…
#. きっと、すぐに会えるはずだからさ…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"L-Listen, don't get so upset. I'm sure you'll see\n"
"her again really soon!"
msgstr ""

#. なんとか天使プリンセスぶー子ちゃんにだってさ…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You'll see your...uh, what was it? Something angel\n"
"pretty pudgy princess?"
msgstr ""

#. …なんとか天使！？
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "\"Something\" angel...? SOMETHING angel!?"
msgstr ""

#. 失敬な！　プリンセスに対して失敬な！
#. ちゃんと正式名称を言わんかぁ！！
msgctxt "0013 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"How dare you insult the princess like that!? Say her\n"
"name right, swine!"
msgstr ""

#. 外道
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Demon"
msgstr ""

#. 仏道
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Dharma"
msgstr ""

#. ええっと、仏道天使だったかな？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was, uh...Dharma Angel, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 和洋折衷ってレベルじゃないですな！
msgctxt "0017 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Dharma? Why would a Japanese anime combine Buddhism\n"
"with a Western-style angel motif!?"
msgstr ""

#. しかし、そういった寛容な姿勢こそが
#. 日本文化の美しさでもあるのです…
msgctxt "0018 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Although, our tolerant and accepting attitude is one\n"
"of the many beauties of Japanese culture..."
msgstr ""

#. やはり苗木誠殿は見所がありますぞ！
msgctxt "0019 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Maybe you're not as dumb as I thought!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうかな？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Seriously...?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、それとこれとは別！
#. ちゃんと正式名称を答えんかぁ！
msgctxt "0021 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"But you're still wrong! You'd better come up with the\n"
"right title, before I...!"
msgstr ""

#. 殴殺
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Damage"
msgstr ""

#. 確か、殴殺天使じゃなかった？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I remember, it was...Damage Angel, right?"
msgstr ""

#. なん…だと…？
#. なぜ…その名を知ってる…！
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "What...? How did you know about that!?"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. それは…企画段階のプリンセスに
#. つけられていた仮称ですぞ…！
msgctxt "0026 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "That was her tentative name during pre-production!"
msgstr ""

#. そう、素人が知るはずのない…！
msgctxt "0027 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "How would a total amateur like you know about that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木誠殿…恐ろしい子っ！
msgctxt "0028 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Makoto... You're a most terrifying prodigy!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>適当に言っただけなんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh...I just kinda said it at random...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. しかしっ！
#. ちゃんと正式名称を言わんかぁ！
msgctxt "0030 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"However! I *will* hear you call her by her proper\n"
"name!"
msgstr ""

#. よもや答えられないとは…！
#. 見損ないましたぞ！
msgctxt "0031 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"If you can't answer, I misjudged you more than I would\n"
"have imagined possible!"
msgstr ""

#. しかし、あまたの特典商法により
#. 鍛えられたこの山田の心は、海よりも広い…
msgctxt "0032 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"However, I am governed by the universal law of free\n"
"commerce, so my heart is open wide to you!"
msgstr ""

#. さあ、今一度チャンスを与えましょう…
#. 再び蘇るのです、苗木誠殿…！
msgctxt "0033 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So I'll give you one more chance... Consider yourself\n"
"Phoenix Down'd!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>正式名称って…
#. えーっと…なんだったっけ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her official name... Uh...what was it again?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんとか天使…までは覚えてるんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I know it was definitely \"something\" angel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …思い出したよ！
#. 外道天使もちもちプリンセスだったよね！？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh! Now I remember! The full title is Demon Angel\n"
"Pretty Pudgy Princess, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>外道天使☆もちもちプリンセス<CLT>…
msgctxt "0037 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It's actually <CLT 3>Demon Angel☆Pretty Pudgy Princess<CLT>, to\n"
"be precise."
msgstr ""

#. 正確には☆が入るのですが、
#. 許してあげましょう。
msgctxt "0038 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"You left out the star. But I suppose I'll let that\n"
"slide."
msgstr ""

#. あ、ありがとう…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-Thanks..."
msgstr ""

#. …て言うか、山田クンって、
#. 本当に、そのアニメが好きなんだね？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But jeez, Hifumi... You really love that anime, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女は、僕の人生を切り開いてくれた恩人ですから。
msgctxt "0041 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Of course. She's my guiding angel. She opened my eyes\n"
"to life."
msgstr ""

#. 当時の僕は友達もいませんでしたし、
#. 絵を描くのが好きな、好青年でしかありませんでした。
msgctxt "0042 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Before her, I didn't have a single friend. I was just\n"
"a mild-mannered boy who liked to draw."
msgstr ""

#. 触るものみな傷付ける…
#. そんなダークサイドに落ちた好青年だったのです。
msgctxt "0043 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I hurt everything I touched. I was a model young lad\n"
"who fell to the Dark Side..."
msgstr ""

#. 唯一の娯楽と言えば、
#. たまに委員長タイプの女子が話しかけてきた時…
msgctxt "0044 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"For example! Sometimes a nicey-nice type girl would\n"
"come try to talk to me, right?"
msgstr ""

#. オレのようなキモイ奴に親切で話しかけて、
#. 偽善者ぶるのはヤメい！！
msgctxt "0045 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"You know, be nice to the weird, dorky kid. And I'd\n"
"scream at her, \"You're such a hypocrite!\""
msgstr ""

#. そう言って泣かす事…
#. それだけが楽しみだったのです。
msgctxt "0046 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I'd just yell right in her face and make her cry.\n"
"Man I loved doing that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>委員長…可哀相過ぎるだろ…
#. トラウマになってもおかしくないって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's awful... He probably traumatized that\n"
"poor girl!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そんな折に、たまたま見たアニメ…
#. それが、外道天使☆もちもちプリンセスでした。
msgctxt "0048 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"But by total chance, I happened to catch an episode of\n"
"Demon Angel☆Pretty Pudgy Princess one day."
msgstr ""

#. 最初に見た時は、むしろ小馬鹿にしておりました。
#. 巷に溢れてる美少女バトル物かと…
msgctxt "0049 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"At first, I felt nothing but contempt for it. I\n"
"thought it was just another magical girl anime."
msgstr ""

#. ですが…
msgctxt "0050 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

#. 夢にね…見たのですよ…
msgctxt "0051 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "...after that, she came to me in my dreams."
msgstr ""

#. …夢？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Your dreams...?"
msgstr ""

#. 僕とぶー子が楽しくデートを重ねる夢です。
msgctxt "0053 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I dreamed that I went on date after lovely date\n"
"with Princess Piggles."
msgstr ""

#. あれは…楽しかったなぁ…
msgctxt "0054 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "It was...so much fun."
msgstr ""

#. 目が覚めて、それが夢だと知った時、
#. 虚脱感と共に彼女に恋をしてる自分に気付きました…
msgctxt "0055 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"When I woke up and realized it was a dream, I got\n"
"depressed. But I also realized...I was in love."
msgstr ""

#. あの萌えるような気持ちをもう１度味わいたくて、
#. すぐに、僕はぶー子関連商品を買い漁りました。
msgctxt "0056 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I wanted to experience that sensation again, so I\n"
"started buying all the Princess Piggles stuff I could."
msgstr ""

#. ですが、困った事に、
#. ぶー子は原作では一切の恋をしないのですよ…
msgctxt "0057 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, in the show itself, the princess never\n"
"falls in love..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、夢で見た彼女の恋する顔だけは、
#. どうやっても見る事が出来なかったのです。
msgctxt "0058 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So as much as I wanted to, I never got to see her face\n"
"filled with love, the way I did in my dream."
msgstr ""

#. 本当は…彼女は恋している時の顔が、
#. 一番かわいいのにね…
msgctxt "0059 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"The face she made when she was in love was the cutest\n"
"thing I've ever seen..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、自分で描く事にしたのです。
#. ぶー子への溢れんばかりの愛情を込めてね！
msgctxt "0060 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"So, filled to the brim with my overflowing affection\n"
"for the princess, I decided to draw that face myself!"
msgstr ""

#. すると一気に情熱が燃え上がり、
#. ぶー子を題材とした作品が次々と完成しました。
msgctxt "0061 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I was consumed with passion, and I finished one\n"
"Princess Piggles project after another."
msgstr ""

#. あまりに出来がいいので、
#. 試しにホームページで公開したところ…
msgctxt "0062 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I was so happy with the results, I decided to put it\n"
"up on my personal website, just to see what happened."
msgstr ""

#. またたく間に、大ヒットとなったのです！！
msgctxt "0063 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "And it was an instant success!"
msgstr ""

#. これが、僕が<CLT 3>同人作家として
#. 生まれ変わった瞬間<CLT>なのです！
msgctxt "0064 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"That was the moment I was <CLT 3>reborn as a true fanfic\n"
"creator<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. そう…だったんだ…
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So that's why, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 僕は嬉しかったなぁ…
msgctxt "0066 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I was so happy..."
msgstr ""

#. 僕と同じような想いを抱く同士が、
#. 世の中に、こんなにいたのかと…
msgctxt "0067 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I had no idea there were other people on the planet\n"
"who'd felt the same things I had."
msgstr ""

#. ぶー子ちゃんには感謝し切れません！
#. だから、僕は…
msgctxt "0068 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I can't thank her, I know that! So instead..."
msgstr ""

#. ありったけの愛を込めて、
#. 彼女を辱めているのです！！
msgctxt "0069 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I'll ball up all my love and affection, and use it to\n"
"do incredibly embarrassing things to her!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少し、間違ってる気もするけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think he missed the mark...by a mile.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、聞けて良かったかも。
#. お陰で、山田クンの事がわかった気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...maybe I'm better off for hearing what he had to\n"
"say. I think I understand him a little better now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ぶー子は、女性としてまだ発展途上なのです！！
#. 今後も僕によって色々と開発されていくのです！
msgctxt "0072 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"She's still developing as a woman, you know! And I can\n"
"keep developing her in all sorts of ways!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>わかるのは…少しだけでいいかもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...And maybe understanding him just a *little* better\n"
"is good enough.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>山田一二三の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hifumi's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“妄想”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Delusion<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンと別れた後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I parted ways with Hifumi, and went back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
